msgid "Security fixes"
msgstr ""

msgid "Today, we released Quarkus 3.27.6, our next maintenance release for the 3.27 LTS stream."
msgstr ""

msgid "This release contains bugfixes, documentation updates, and security fixes."
msgstr ""

msgid "It should be a safe upgrade for anyone already using 3.27."
msgstr "3.27 をすでに使用している方にとっては、安全にアップグレードできます。"

msgid ""
"Please note that this is planned to be the last update to 3.27. Anybody still on 3.27 is advised\n"
"to look into upgrading to 3.33 or 3.40 (the next LTS) soon."
msgstr ""

msgid "This release fixes the following CVEs:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Quarkus and direct dependencies"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-89407[CVE-2026-89407] - FasterXML jackson-core: Denial of Service via quadratic regex backtracking in number validation"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-89425[CVE-2026-89425] - FasterXML jackson-core: Denial of Service via unbounded error-token accumulation in `UTF8DataInputJsonParser`"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-91777[CVE-2026-91777] - FasterXML jackson-databind: Denial of Service via quadratic-time forward-reference resolution for `@JsonIdentityInfo`"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-91776[CVE-2026-91776] - FasterXML jackson-databind: Denial of Service via unbounded deserializer cache growth for unrecognized polymorphic type IDs"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-84939[CVE-2026-84939] - Apache FreeMarker: Path traversal via malformed locale identifier"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-94449[CVE-2026-94449] - Quarkus SmallRye Fault Tolerance: Memory leak in `@ApplyGuard` leads to Denial of Service"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-82617[CVE-2026-82617] - Apache OpenNLP: Denial of Service via super-linear regex backtracking in built-in name finders"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-68497[CVE-2026-68497] - Jackson-databind: Denial of Service via unbounded number parsing for `Duration`/`XMLGregorianCalendar`"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-89059[CVE-2026-89059] - RESTEasy: Denial of Service via unbounded memory allocation in `IIOImageProvider`"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-93432[CVE-2026-93432] - Quarkus Qute: Cross-Site Scripting via missing content-type propagation in `{#eval}` sub-templates"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-59949[CVE-2026-59949] - LZ4 Java: Denial of Service via native XXHash crash on invalid byte array ranges"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-61700[CVE-2026-61700] - MariaDB Connector/J: `allowLocalInfile=false` bypass via server-initiated LOCAL INFILE request"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-55856[CVE-2026-55856] - MariaDB Connector/J: Cleartext password disclosure via MITM on the initial handshake"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-55857[CVE-2026-55857] - MariaDB Connector/J: Cleartext transmission of credentials during PAM authentication"
msgstr ""

msgid "https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2026-55858[CVE-2026-55858] - MariaDB Connector/J: Data corruption via incorrect character set handling after a mid-session charset change"
msgstr ""

msgid "Platform updates"
msgstr "プラットフォームの更新"

msgid "This release includes https://docs.quarkiverse.io/quarkus-cxf/dev/release-notes/3.27.2.html[Quarkus CXF 3.27.2]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Update"
msgstr "Update"

msgid "To update to Quarkus 3.27, we recommend updating to the latest version of the Quarkus CLI and run:"
msgstr "Quarkus 3.27 に更新するには、Quarkus CLI の最新バージョンに更新してから、以下を実行することをお勧めします。"

msgid "Note that `quarkus update` can update your applications from any version of Quarkus (including 2.x) to Quarkus 3.27."
msgstr "`quarkus update` は、Quarkus の任意のバージョン (2.x を含む) から Quarkus 3.27 にアプリケーションを更新できます。"

msgid "Full changelog"
msgstr "完全な変更履歴"

msgid "You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/3.27.6[the full changelog of 3.27.6 on GitHub]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "参加のお誘い"

msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "私達は皆様からのフィードバックに重きを置いています。バグ報告、改善要望を是非お願いします。一緒に素晴らしいものを作り上げていきましょう!"

msgid "If you are a Quarkus user or just curious, don't be shy and join our welcoming community:"
msgstr "Quarkusユーザーの場合でも、単に興味を持っているだけの場合でも、恥ずかしがらずにコミュニティに参加して下さい!:"

msgid "provide feedback on https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub];"
msgstr "https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/issues[GitHub] でフィードバック"

msgid "craft some code and https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[push a PR];"
msgstr "コードを作成し、 https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/pulls[プルリクエスト] を送信"

msgid "discuss with us on https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] and on the https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[mailing list];"
msgstr "https://quarkusio.zulipchat.com/[Zulip] や https://groups.google.com/d/forum/quarkus-dev[メーリングリスト] でディスカッションに参加"

msgid "ask your questions on https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow]."
msgstr "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/quarkus[Stack Overflow] で質問"
